{"3532640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Waste Force", "steam_appid": 3532640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/8078c1ff5a77536ddd28eace0d0d405f.avif?t=1782436513\" width=1000 height=296 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to nuclear war, buried under mountains of trash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The surviving remnants of humanity were driven from the desolate surface and retreated underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/8051b8f6c4ea77e1075bb3b72c9c4bc9.poster.avif?t=1782436513\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/8051b8f6c4ea77e1075bb3b72c9c4bc9.webm?t=1782436513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/8051b8f6c4ea77e1075bb3b72c9c4bc9.mp4?t=1782436513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>H.O.P.E (Humanity’s Operational Purification Enterprise)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>H.O.P.E</strong> is a great and noble government agency established to save humanity underground. To purify the contaminated surface, <strong>H.O.P.E</strong> has organized the <strong>'Waste Force.'</strong> You will become a member of the <strong>'Waste Force'</strong> and take on the mission of purifying the polluted land to rebuild the home of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>History will remember you as hope.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/f50668e68275c174530584c371c5a1e4.poster.avif?t=1782436513\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/f50668e68275c174530584c371c5a1e4.webm?t=1782436513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/f50668e68275c174530584c371c5a1e4.mp4?t=1782436513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Purification Work Without Rest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The threats of the desolate surface do not leave the <strong>'Waste Force'</strong> alone. There is no time to stop the waste truck! Someone must drive, someone must repair the moving vehicle, and you must purify the surface by destroying the waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/29452fbb836f1ced642829db93e2edde.poster.avif?t=1782436513\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/29452fbb836f1ced642829db93e2edde.webm?t=1782436513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/29452fbb836f1ced642829db93e2edde.mp4?t=1782436513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Marauders Everywhere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is no longer the master of the polluted land. Hungry mutants, crazed scavengers seeking resources, and cyborg fanatics are in pursuit of you. Overcome all threats—including bizarre supernatural phenomena that can swallow a vehicle in an instant—and complete your mission safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/ee6f80704438268361506cdadd832026.poster.avif?t=1782436513\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/ee6f80704438268361506cdadd832026.webm?t=1782436513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/ee6f80704438268361506cdadd832026.mp4?t=1782436513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Evolving Waste Truck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the desolate surface, resources are always scarce. You must be able to cope with any situation. Connect trailers with special abilities and equip various parts to <strong>build your own powerful waste truck.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/9bba2a9e640ae3db0c766b1d5fa930c8.poster.avif?t=1782436513\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/9bba2a9e640ae3db0c766b1d5fa930c8.webm?t=1782436513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/9bba2a9e640ae3db0c766b1d5fa930c8.mp4?t=1782436513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to nuclear war, buried under mountains of trash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The surviving remnants of humanity were driven from the desolate surface and retreated underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/8051b8f6c4ea77e1075bb3b72c9c4bc9.poster.avif?t=1782436513\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/8051b8f6c4ea77e1075bb3b72c9c4bc9.webm?t=1782436513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/8051b8f6c4ea77e1075bb3b72c9c4bc9.mp4?t=1782436513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>H.O.P.E (Humanity’s Operational Purification Enterprise)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>H.O.P.E</strong> is a great and noble government agency established to save humanity underground. To purify the contaminated surface, <strong>H.O.P.E</strong> has organized the <strong>'Waste Force.'</strong> You will become a member of the <strong>'Waste Force'</strong> and take on the mission of purifying the polluted land to rebuild the home of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>History will remember you as hope.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/f50668e68275c174530584c371c5a1e4.poster.avif?t=1782436513\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/f50668e68275c174530584c371c5a1e4.webm?t=1782436513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/f50668e68275c174530584c371c5a1e4.mp4?t=1782436513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Purification Work Without Rest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The threats of the desolate surface do not leave the <strong>'Waste Force'</strong> alone. There is no time to stop the waste truck! Someone must drive, someone must repair the moving vehicle, and you must purify the surface by destroying the waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/29452fbb836f1ced642829db93e2edde.poster.avif?t=1782436513\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/29452fbb836f1ced642829db93e2edde.webm?t=1782436513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/29452fbb836f1ced642829db93e2edde.mp4?t=1782436513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Marauders Everywhere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is no longer the master of the polluted land. Hungry mutants, crazed scavengers seeking resources, and cyborg fanatics are in pursuit of you. Overcome all threats—including bizarre supernatural phenomena that can swallow a vehicle in an instant—and complete your mission safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/ee6f80704438268361506cdadd832026.poster.avif?t=1782436513\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/ee6f80704438268361506cdadd832026.webm?t=1782436513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/ee6f80704438268361506cdadd832026.mp4?t=1782436513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Evolving Waste Truck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the desolate surface, resources are always scarce. You must be able to cope with any situation. Connect trailers with special abilities and equip various parts to <strong>build your own powerful waste truck.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/9bba2a9e640ae3db0c766b1d5fa930c8.poster.avif?t=1782436513\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/9bba2a9e640ae3db0c766b1d5fa930c8.webm?t=1782436513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/extras/9bba2a9e640ae3db0c766b1d5fa930c8.mp4?t=1782436513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "&lt;Waste Force&gt; is a post-apocalyptic PvE extraction shooter. Drive a garbage truck with your crew and survive oncoming mutants and scavengers. Repair the vehicle during chases and collect resources. Connect special trailers to complete your own vehicle. Cleanse the surface as part of Waste Force!", "supported_languages": "Korean, English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Russian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/e11f4108452e73b96f6d4caeac72a15002ad4e0e/header.jpg?t=1782436513", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/dcb9f1e19d84860f690a361b399ab6734a64bba8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782436513", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532640/dcb9f1e19d84860f690a361